    "parent_document_id": "mitre-attack-enterprise",
    "source_type": "snapshot",
    "access_labels": ["public", "synthetic"],
    "metadata": {"source_id": "mitre-attack-enterprise", "framework": "MITRE ATT&CK", "technique_id": "T1078", "tactic": "Defense Evasion, Persistence, Privilege Escalation, Initial Access", "scenario": "lateral_movement"},
    "content": "攻击者可能获取并滥用现有账号凭证，以绕过访问控制、访问远程系统或提升权限。异常设备、异常时段、权限变化、服务账号交互式登录和跨主机登录扩散是重要观测点；应同时检查合法运维窗口、多因素认证、账号用途和设备合规状态。"
  },
  {
